{"identity":{"original_title":"Tyrant's Realm","developers":["Team Tyrant"],"publishers":["Skystone Games"],"release_status":"released","release_date":"2025-01-16","tags":["角色扮演","复古","动作肉鸽","黑暗奇幻","三维画面"]},"hooks":[{"text":"搜索隐藏Skull Altars强化武器、护甲与角色力量","dimension":"玩法","excerpt":"Unlock new weapons and armor and find hidden Skull Altars to upgrade your power., and arm yourself for the endless journey ahead.","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2259260/","label":"证据原文片段"},{"text":"每次死亡后学习重来，挑战强度随尝试持续增加","dimension":"玩法","excerpt":"Fight, die, learn, and rise again as the challenge intensifies with every attempt.","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2259260/","label":"证据原文片段"},{"text":"以粗粝低多边形视觉致敬PS1时代","dimension":"画风","excerpt":"Tyrants Realm is not just a roguelite, it’s a homage to the gritty, low-poly visuals of the PS1 era.","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2259260/","label":"证据原文片段"}],"opinions":[{"text":"PS1式视觉被部分玩家认为丑陋。","dimension":"画风","source":"鉴赏家观点","polarity":"需留意","excerpts":[{"excerpt":"Ugly visuals as a feature?","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/8036387-Gamers-for-pure-games/","label":"证据原文片段"}]},{"text":"PS1画面与纹理很有魅力。","dimension":"画风","source":"玩家观点","polarity":"喜欢","excerpts":[{"excerpt":"very charming PS1 graphics and textures!","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198010779009/recommended/2259260/","label":"证据原文片段"}]},{"text":"粗粝的复古画面很棒。","dimension":"画风","source":"玩家观点","polarity":"喜欢","excerpts":[{"excerpt":"The crunchy graphics are great","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/CLuch/recommended/2259260/","label":"证据原文片段"}]},{"text":"最优解会把玩家导向相同构筑。","dimension":"玩法","source":"玩家观点","polarity":"需留意","excerpts":[{"excerpt":"railroad you into the same build every time","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/CLuch/recommended/2259260/","label":"证据原文片段"}]},{"text":"战斗控制过于不稳定。","dimension":"玩法","source":"玩家观点","polarity":"需留意","excerpts":[{"excerpt":"overly wonky combat control.","url":"https://steamcommuni